<task id="090" project="messaging-communication-app-r2">
  <metadata>
    <title>Project wrap-up — README → Complete + graduation criteria, lessons-learned, `/test-diet` gate, `/code-review` close-out, `/devops-project-archive`, TASK-INDEX reconciliation</title>
    <phase>Wrap</phase>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <estimated-hours>4</estimated-hours>
    <deps>001, 002, 003, 004, 010, 011, 020, 021, 022, 023, 030, 040, 041, 050, 051, 060, 070, 071, 080, 081</deps>
    <blocks></blocks>
    <tags>wrapup</tags>
    <rigor>STANDARD</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Project-close orchestration: status flip + graduation annotation, lessons-learned, mandatory `/test-diet` reconciliation gate (root §7), final holistic `code-review`, `/devops-project-archive`, and TASK-INDEX reconciliation. Writes project-close state + invokes gates — MUST run from the main session (root §3). STANDARD rigor with an explicit test-diet gate.</rigor-reason>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Main-session-only: runs the `/test-diet` gate, updates project-close state, produces the final review, and archives the project after ALL work tasks complete. Cannot be delegated to a subagent (touches project-close state + gates; §3 write boundary).</parallel-reason>
    <fr-refs></fr-refs>
