  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="root §7">A `090-wrapup-*` task MUST invoke `/test-diet` BEFORE marking the project complete; the wrap-up PR MUST cite `notes/test-diet-report.md` (or document the skip rationale). Skipping is a HARD WARNING.</constraint>
    <constraint source="root §3">Main-session only — this task writes project-close state + runs gates + archives; do NOT delegate to a subagent.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">`/test-diet` classifies per the build-vs-maintain criteria; the skill is read-only (emits `git rm`/`git mv` for the reviewer; no auto-execute).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Final `code-review` is a project-close gate; address Critical findings before declaring complete (special attention: the access-parity/read model [no membership-union] + the 050/070 shared-path edits).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Record the notification-spine reserve-only alignment (NFR-06 — `communication-arrived` kind + envelope) + the future poll→push increment in lessons-learned.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Run `/devops-project-archive` to archive the project (Status + Closed Date + counts + close Issue + `.archived` marker; worktree preserved).</constraint>
  </constraints>

