  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1" name="Verify all tasks complete">Read `TASK-INDEX.md`; confirm every W0–W8 task is ✅ (or explicitly documented as deferred/owner-handoff). If any remain 🔲/🔄 unexpectedly, STOP and report.</step>
    <step order="2" name="README → Complete + graduation">Update the README status to Complete; summarize shipped W0–W8 scope + annotate the 9 spec Success Criteria as met (or owner-handoff/deferred).</step>
    <step order="3" name="Lessons-learned">Author `notes/lessons-learned.md` (shared-path 050/070 + characterization guards, ADR-034 path-C junction, ADR-046 path-C RegardingResolver reuse, T-1 VisualHost count-only, impersonation + 2-rule read model / access-parity, dual-deploy discipline, publish-size trajectory vs ~46.99 MB, notification-spine reserve-only + poll→push, deferred items).</step>
    <step order="4" name="/test-diet gate">Invoke `/test-diet`; produce `notes/test-diet-report.md` (MAINTAIN keep / SCAFFOLDING `git rm` / AMBIGUOUS reviewer-judgment). Do NOT auto-execute the emitted commands.</step>
    <step order="5" name="Final code-review">Run a final holistic `code-review` across the R2 close-out diff surface (special attention: access-parity/read model [no membership-union], 050/070 shared-path edits); address Critical findings.</step>
    <step order="6" name="/devops-project-archive">Run `/devops-project-archive` — set Status + Closed Date, capture counts, close the Issue, retain folder + `.archived` marker (worktree preserved per operator workflow).</step>
    <step order="7" name="Reconcile + reset">Mark task 090 ✅ in `TASK-INDEX.md`; confirm full reconciliation; set `current-task.md` to "none — project complete".</step>
    <step order="8" name="Ready to merge">Confirm the project is complete and ready for `merge-to-master`; the wrap-up PR cites `notes/test-diet-report.md`.</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>
    <tool name="read">Verify task completion + gather close artifacts</tool>
